# Game sprites (bench/game.asm), artifact color: . black, O orange,
# B blue, W white.  An artifact pixel is twice as wide as it is tall, so
# these are drawn 8 wide for a 16-pixel look.  Halos are "across down":
# horizontal speeds are half the vertical ones (FL_HALFX), so a 1-pixel
# halo across covers 2 screen pixels.

# The player's ship: 1 pixel a frame across (2 screen pixels), 2 down
sprite ship artifact halo 1 2
...WW...
...WW...
..WBBW..
..WBBW..
.WWBBWW.
.WWWWWW.
B.WWWW.B
BWWWWWWB
WWWOOWWW
WW.OO.WW
W..OO..W
...OO...
end

# The ship's shot: a white column, 4 rows a frame (no horizontal halo:
# it only moves up)
sprite shot artifact halo 0 4
W
W
W
W
W
W
end

# Alien bomb: 3 rows a frame down, up to 1 pixel across (thrown along
# a dive: it keeps the alien's sideways speed)
sprite bomb artifact halo 1 3
O
O
W
O
O
end

# The ship at warp speed, with its afterburner: two flame lengths that
# alternate (same height, so each one's halo covers the other's flame and
# switching needs no erase).  Flies straight up at up to 4 rows a frame: halo 0 across, 4 down.
sprite shipw1 artifact halo 1 6 shift 3
...WW...
...WW...
..WBBW..
..WBBW..
.WWBBWW.
.WWWWWW.
B.WWWW.B
BWWWWWWB
WWWOOWWW
WW.OO.WW
W..OO..W
...OO...
...WW...
..OWWO..
...OO...
....O...
........
........
end

sprite shipw2 artifact halo 1 6 shift 3
...WW...
...WW...
..WBBW..
..WBBW..
.WWBBWW.
.WWWWWW.
B.WWWW.B
BWWWWWWB
WWWOOWWW
WW.OO.WW
W..OO..W
...OO...
..OWWO..
..OOOO..
...OO...
...O....
...O....
...O....
end

# The boss's core (its weak spot), 4x4, and its flash when hit.  Drawn
# over the boss's opening; moves with the boss.
sprite core artifact halo 1 1
.WW.
WOBW
WBOW
.WW.
end

sprite corehit artifact halo 1 1
WWWW
WWWW
WWWW
WWWW
end

# The core behind its closed hatch, while envoys protect it (same box as
# core, so switching needs no erase)
sprite coreshut artifact halo 1 1
BBBB
BWWB
BWWB
BBBB
end
